nd the Senate Leadership Fund says he is only showing up for himself. His campaign says Hinson also skipped work for a fundraiser.","u":"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/dem-senate-hopeful-pocketed-massive-taxpayer-funded-cash-while-skipping-hundreds-votes"},{"l":null,"t":"Second line of attack: Republicans call him Chuck Schumer's puppet, and Schumer's leadership PAC did give him the maximum.","u":"https://www.washingtonsun.com/2026-election/josh-turek-iowa-primary-win-november"},{"l":null,"t":"Strongest coalition: a broad small donor base the campaign puts at nearly 53,000 donors, and a record of winning a Trump district. He outraised Hinson in the second quarter, $2.81M to $2.06M.","u":"https://www.telegraphherald.com/news/tri-state/article_2cd0cb77-bdc6-4bc9-b3b4-8a1db6f769cc.amp.html"},{"l":null,"t":"Notable recent event: Senate Majority PAC added $17M in fall ads on July 23 on top of a $13.4M reservation. As of August 24 Cook and Fox call the race a toss up, Inside Elections tilts Republican and Sabato leans Hinson.","u":"https://carrollspaper.com/news/state/national-democratic-pac-announces-17m-fall-ad-buy-targeting-ashley-hinson/article_e0ddbe2b-627a-5a45-87c1-1e78edda100a.html"},{"l":null,"t":"Cash gap: Hinson held $6,749,491 to his $2,362,314 on June 30, 2026.","u":"https://littlevillagemag.com/turek-democrats-outraise-republicans/"}],"blocs":["Party and leadership","Ideological groups","Small donors"],"money":{"receipts":6276526.9,"cash":2362313.78,"outside_for":66121155.93,"spent":3914213.12,"google_ads":3089900.0,"as_of":"09/30/2026"},"health":45},{"side":"R","name":"Ashley Hinson","party":"R","inc":false,"file":"IA-ashley-hinson","intel":[{"l":null,"t":"Main message: Trump endorsed Republican running on taxes, veterans and costs, with One Nation ads on ending the estate tax and her own ads attacking Turek since June.","u":"https://www.bleedingheartland.com/?p=458547"},{"l":null,"t":"Biggest vulnerability as opponents frame it: personal enrichment. Sena